<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" data-theme="light">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <title>Preview — Núcleos | Unio</title>
    {% include 'components/platform_favicon.html.twig' %}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Sora:wght@600;700;800&display=swap">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/admin-lte@3.2/dist/css/adminlte.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@4.6.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    {% include 'components/unio_theme_vars.html.twig' %}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('css/unio-app.min.css') }}?v=260">
    <style>
        html, body { height: 100%; overflow: hidden; margin: 0; }
        body { background: #f1f5f9; padding: 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
        #capture-root {
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
        }
        .preview-shell {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr;
            width: 1440px;
            height: 900px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .preview-sidebar {
            background: var(--sidebar-bg, #0a0f1a);
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
            height: 100%;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 12px 0 24px;
        }
        .preview-sidebar-brand {
            padding: 16px 18px 20px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .preview-sidebar-brand img {
            height: 28px;
            width: auto;
        }
        .preview-sidebar-brand span {
            display: block;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--text-3);
            margin-top: 6px;
        }
        .preview-main {
            background: var(--bg);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            min-width: 0;
        }
        .preview-topbar {
            height: 56px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 24px;
            gap: 16px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .preview-search {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 420px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: var(--surface);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 14px;
            gap: 8px;
            color: var(--text-3);
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        .preview-topbar-chip {
            width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(79,127,255,0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(79,127,255,0.3);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent);
        }
        .preview-content {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 40px 48px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .preview-content h1 {
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-1);
            margin: 0 0 8px;
        }
        .preview-content p {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: var(--text-2);
            margin: 0 0 28px;
            max-width: 520px;
        }
        .preview-hint {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: rgba(79,127,255,0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(79,127,255,0.2);
            color: var(--accent);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .sidebar-hub-group-label {
            display: block;
            padding: 10px 18px 6px;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--text-3);
        }
        .sidebar-hub-group-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
        .sidebar-hub-pick-item > .nav-link {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 8px 18px;
            color: var(--text-2);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        .sidebar-hub-pick-item > .nav-link > .nav-icon {
            width: 18px;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-3);
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        .sidebar-hub-pick-item > .nav-link > p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; }
        .sidebar-hub-pick-item > .nav-link:hover,
        .sidebar-hub-pick-item > .nav-link.is-highlight {
            background: rgba(79,127,255,0.08);
            color: var(--text-1);
        }
        .sidebar-hub-pick-item > .nav-link.is-highlight > .nav-icon { color: var(--accent); }
        .sidebar-hub-heading-label {
            display: block;
            padding: 14px 18px 8px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-2);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="preview-shell" id="capture-root">
    <aside class="preview-sidebar">
        <div class="preview-sidebar-brand">
            {% include 'components/platform_logo.html.twig' with { variant: 'full' } only %}
            <span>Nexus Saúde · workspace</span>
        </div>
        <span class="sidebar-hub-heading-label">Núcleo selecionado</span>
        {% for group in hub_groups %}
        <div class="sidebar-hub-group">
            <span class="sidebar-hub-group-label">{{ group.label }}</span>
            <ul class="sidebar-hub-group-list">
                {% for hub in group.hubs %}
                <li class="sidebar-hub-pick-item">
                    <a href="#" class="nav-link{% if hub.id == 'ti' %} is-highlight{% endif %}">
                        <i class="fas {{ hub.icon }} nav-icon"></i>
                        <p>{{ hub.label }}</p>
                    </a>
                </li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </aside>
    <div class="preview-main">
        <header class="preview-topbar">
            <div class="preview-search">
                <i class="fas fa-magnifying-glass"></i>
                <span>Buscar núcleos, apps e membros…</span>
            </div>
            <div class="preview-topbar-chip">JA</div>
        </header>
        <div class="preview-content">
            <h1>Escolha seu núcleo de trabalho</h1>
            <p>Selecione um centro de excelência na barra lateral. Cada núcleo reúne módulos, indicadores e fluxos da sua área.</p>
            <div class="preview-hint">
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i>
                30+ núcleos modulares · mesma autenticação · permissões por perfil
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
